# WORKFLOW_examples/
# Workflow XML files in the DISSECT-CF format. The seed demo files
# (CyberShake_100.xml, IoT_CyberShake_100.xml, IoT_workflow.xml) stay
# tracked; the rest is generated by:
#   - src/main/resources/script/generate_workflows.py   (WfCommons recipes)
#   - src/main/resources/script/random_workflow_generator.py  (chaotic DAGs)
#   - src/main/resources/script/generate_training_corpus.py   (200-element corpus)
